              "text": "Wait, and listen"
            }
          ],
          "narration": "You pick up the thread where you left it. The hour has not moved while you were away, and neither has anything else.",
          "resumed": true,
          "scene_image": "/static/art/scenes/noticeboard.jpg",
          "state": {
            "active_arc": "quiet_life",
            "archetype": "wayfarer",
            "carry": {
              "limit": 25.0,
              "overloaded": false,
              "weight": 0.8
            },
            "challenge": {},
            "encounter": {},
            "ended": false,
            "endings": {
              "fail_forward": "the_dark_keeps_its_hours",
              "forced": true,
              "gallery": [
                {
                  "closeness": "faint",
                  "gate": "any: [{'quest_completed': 'bakery_apprentice'}, {'quest_completed': 'winter_stores'}, {'quest_completed': 'neighbours_ro and flag: nf_hearth_book_closed",
                  "id": "the_hearth_holds",
                  "lock_reason": "Nobody in Edgewood would miss you yet, and that is the whole of what this ending is made of. You have not said you are staying. Not out loud, not to yourself.",
                  "tier": "locked",
                  "title": "The Hearth Holds"
                },
                {
                  "closeness": "none",
                  "gate": "min_awareness: 30 and any: [{'quest_completed': 'childs_drawing'}, {'quest_completed': 'not_right'}, {'quest_completed': 'rumour_made_true'},  and any: [{'flag': 'nf_hearth_book_closed'}, {'quest_completed': 'the_last_quiet_thing'}]",
                  "id": "the_long_witness",
                  "lock_reason": "You have not seen anything you could not explain to yourself by breakfast. The wrong things have been in front of you for weeks. You have not once looked twice. Knowing is not this. Staying with what you know is this, and you have not chosen it.",
                  "tier": "locked",
                  "title": "The Long Witness"
                },
                {
                  "closeness": "none",
                  "gate": "arc_unlocked: march and reputation: {'faction': 'militia', 'min': 20} and any: [{'quest_completed': 'militia_press'}, {'quest_completed': 'conscription_list'}, {'quest_completed': 'toll_roads'}, and flag: nf_hearth_book_closed",
                  "id": "the_counted_march",
                  "lock_reason": "The road inward has soldiers on it, and you have not once stood where they could count you. Sera's ledger has your name in the column for strangers. Strangers are not mustered out; they are moved on. You have watched the arithmetic being done with people. Watching is not a discharge. The sergeant cannot strike a name that has not said it is done.",
                  "tier": "locked",
                  "title": "The Counted March"
                },
                {
                  "closeness": "none",
                  "gate": "quest_completed: naming_the_wound and quest_completed: what_edgewood_keeps",
                  "id": "the_named_wound",
                  "lock_reason": "It is still eleven separate wrong things to you. It has a shape, and you have not paid what looking at it costs. Edgewood does not know what you know, and what it does not know it cannot choose about.",
                  "tier": "locked",
                  "title": "The Named Wound"
                },
                {
                  "closeness": "none",
                  "gate": "quest_completed: the_sacrifice and flag: nf_sacrifice_paid",
                  "id": "the_price_asked",
                  "lock_reason": "Sympathy takes a like for a like, and you have not put anything on the table. It is still in your hands. Everything is negotiable until your hand comes off it.",
                  "tier": "locked",
                  "title": "The Price Asked"
                },
                {
                  "closeness": "none",
                  "gate": "flag: nf_ninth_taken and has_item: {'id': 'ninth_pin', 'qty': 1} and quest_completed: the_heartland_road",
                  "id": "the_pin_and_the_join",
                  "lock_reason": "The ninth pin is still on Ilya's felt, and he has never once said it is not for sale. You had it, and you spent it, or you left it somewhere a pin like that should never be left. You do not know where it goes. It goes where the two ends of the road were made to meet.",
                  "tier": "locked",
                  "title": "The Pin and the Join"
                },
                {
                  "closeness": "none",
                  "gate": "value: {'name': 'evil_progress', 'min': 1.0}",
                  "id": "the_stopped_wheel",
                  "lock_reason": "The world is still turning. This is not that ending, yet.",
                  "tier": "locked",
                  "title": "The Stopped Wheel"
                },
                {
